# Quarry: makes minerals (stone) from the rocks within the harvest radius around it. It stands anywhere: its yield
# follows what stands around it. No field, no light use. A 4x4x4 m box (2x2 cells). Spawned origin 2.0 above ground.
# SHAPE (a placeholder; uniform scales of the baseshapes variants): a STONE YARD - a stone floor (the root), a large
# cut block with a smaller one turned on top of it, a second block beside them, and a timber CRANE in a corner: a
# mast of two pieces, an arm (a pillar turned on its side) and a block hanging under the arm. The child pieces are
# render-only.
